<title>USA: BHC Communications sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>BHC Communications sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BHC Communications Inc says it declared a special cash dividend of $1.00 per share on all outstanding shares of the company's Class A and Class B common stock.</p>
<p>It said the dividend is payable February 7, to stockholders of record January 29.</p>
<p>Chris-Craft Industries owns about 76 percent of BHC's outstanding equity and 96 percent of BHC's outstanding voting power.</p>
</text>
